<title>USA: Marvel slips after Q3 loss warning.</title>
<headline>Marvel slips after Q3 loss warning.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Marvel Entertainment Group Inc fell over 26 percent on Wednesday after it warned of a third quarter net loss late on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Marvel shares slipped 2-1/8 to 5-7/8. It said it expects a loss of between $0.07 and $0.12 a share for the third quarter ended September 20, including a one time gain.</p>
</text>
